# Reduced TERPSICHORE External-Region Snapshot

This source directory is a reduced snapshot derived from the TERPSICHORE-native
migration work inside DESC.

The retained slice keeps the real package structure for a wall-coupled external
region workflow:

- radial grid and mode-table handling;
- equilibrium-to-boundary adaptation;
- pseudo-vacuum metric construction;
- outer-region integral/operator preparation;
- plasma and outer-region block assembly;
- interval-energy reduction for reduced stability diagnostics.

The snapshot is smaller than the full DESC repository, but it is still arranged
as a real migration subpackage rather than a hand-written toy API.

